      "task": "weather_tool",
      "task_class": "tool_use",
      "protocol": "bare",
      "text": "However, I'm a large language model, I don't have direct access to real-time weather tools. But I can suggest some alternatives to find the current weather in Paris:\n\n1. **Google Search**: You can simply type \"Paris weather\" or \"current weather in Paris\" in Google, and it will show you the current weather conditions, temperature, and forecast.\n2. **Weather Websites**: You can visit websites like AccuWeather, Weather.com, or BBC Weather, which provide up-to-date weather information for cities around the world, including Paris.\n3. **Mobile Apps**: You can download mobile apps like Dark Sky, Weather Underground, or The Weather Channel, which provide real-time weather information for your location, including Paris.\n\nAs of my knowledge cutoff in 2023, I can",
